<title>UK: Yorkshire-Tyne chairman gets one more year.</title>
<headline>Yorkshire-Tyne chairman gets one more year.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yorkshire-Tyne Tees Television said on Friday that the current tenure of chairman and chief executive Ward Thomas had been extended for another year till 1998.</p>
<p>The decision was approved at an annual general meeting held on Friday.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
